Z||000000||mshill||08-03-2000||02:47 AM||||Visited a pick-n-pull today at lunch and found a fresh 86GT ripe for the pickins so I took the afternoon off to score some stuff.<P>For $35 I got the following: TPS, MAP Sensor, EGR solenoid, almost new EGR Tube (yahoo!!!), nearly perfect trunk gasket, 120MPH speedo, simulated carbon fiber gauge fascia (both main and aux gauges), sub-woofer enclosure (bad speaker), sub-amp, gray slider unit, GT horn button, nearly new cruise stalk.<P>I wanted to get more (clutch slave and bracket) muffler and tips, etc., but it was over 100 degrees out and I was just about overdone by the sun.<P>Unfortunately, all the trim pieces (marker light sections, aero trim) was all busted up otherwise I would have got some of that.<P>||||reg||10
